gends)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/draconic-evolution\" rel=\"nofollow\">Draconic Evolution (от brandon3055)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania-garden-of-glass\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania: Garden of Glass (от Vazkii)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-petroleum\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Petroleum (от Flaxbeard)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-petroleum\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Petroleum (от BordListian)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/controlling\" rel=\"nofollow\">Controlling (от Jaredlll08)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wawla\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wawla - What Are We Looking At (от DarkhaxDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2wtlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 Wireless Terminal Library (от TheRealp455w0rd)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-innovation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Innovation (от TeamCoFH)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corail-tombstone\" rel=\"nofollow\">Corail Tombstone (от Corail_31)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bisecthosting-server-integration-menu-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting Server Integration Menu [FORGE] (от BisectHosting)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/furnace-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Furnace Overhaul (от TheCazadorSniper)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae-additions-extra-cells-2-fork\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE Additions - ExtraCells2 Fork (от MasterYodAT9G)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diet-hoppers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Diet Hoppers (от Forge_User_06804776)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/redstone-arsenal\" rel=\"nofollow\">Redstone Arsenal (от TeamCoFH)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/contenttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">ContentTweaker (от Jaredlll08)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/packmode\" rel=\"nofollow\">PackMode (от Sky_Som)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cooking-for-blockheads\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cooking for Blockheads (от BlayTheNinth)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blood-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blood Magic (от WayofTime)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abyssalcraft-integration\" rel=\"nofollow\">AbyssalCraft Integration (от Shinoow)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-energistics-jee\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Energistics (JEE) (от TheRealp455w0rd)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magneticraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Magneticraft (от cout970)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-utilities-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Utilities (Forge) (от FTB)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI) (от mezz)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/embers-rekindled\" rel=\"nofollow\">Embers Rekindled (от BordListian)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toast-control\" rel=\"nofollow\">Toast Control (от Shadows_of_Fire)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lootbags\" rel=\"nofollow\">LootBags (от Mina_the_Engineer)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mputils\" rel=\"nofollow\">MPUtils (от GenDeathrow)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gunpowderlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GunpowderLib (от Jackyy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ww